Paseo server runtime mechanisms, original client SDK and ConnectedHosts source. Apache-2.0.
Original files are preserved at the paths and SHA-256 digests recorded in sources.json.
Generated SDK bundles use a Tervell local driver for local operations, and original Paseo transport for connected hosts. Host operation projection and UI placements are maintained separately by Tervell.
The outbound validation adapter uses the original Zod protocol schema instead of its generated AOT validator. Proxy selection is supplied by the Tervell environment adapter.
ACP SDK 1.4.0 and connection dependencies retain their original licenses and npm integrity metadata.
